{"id":"a35e12f215cc7e60","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus.md","title":"Pohlers Infinitary Calculus","display":"df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus — Pohlers Infinitary Calculus","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus","aliases":["72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus"],"display":"df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus — Pohlers Infinitary Calculus","depends_on":["[[72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity, Springer, copyright 2009 (local catalog 2008)","source_location":"Def7.3.5 print112/PDF122; Def8.3.1 print135/PDF145","verification_status":"source-and-signature-reviewed","proof_status":"definition-well-foundedness-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus — Pohlers Infinitary Calculus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7fc22c4e13a7c2b8\" href=\"?note=7fc22c4e13a7c2b8\" title=\"72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language\">72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity, Springer, copyright 2009 (local catalog 2008)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Def7.3.5 print112/PDF122; Def8.3.1 print135/PDF145"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-signature-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-foundedness-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7fc22c4e13a7c2b8\" href=\"?note=7fc22c4e13a7c2b8\" title=\"72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language\">72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language</a>的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L,\\mathsf W,\\mathsf D,v,\\operatorname{rk},\\operatorname{CS},\\sim\">\\(\\mathsf L,\\mathsf W,\\mathsf D,v,\\operatorname{rk},\\operatorname{CS},\\sim\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\rho,\\beta\\in\\omega_1\">\\(\\alpha,\\rho,\\beta\\in\\omega_1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Fin}(\\mathsf L)\">\\(\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Fin}(\\mathsf L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\\in\\mathsf L\">\\(F,G\\in\\mathsf L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta,F\">\\(\\Delta,F\\)</span>缩写<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\cup\\{F\\}\">\\(\\Delta\\cup\\{F\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\omega_1\\times\\omega_1\\times\\operatorname{Fin}(\\mathsf L)\">\\(U=\\omega_1\\times\\omega_1\\times\\operatorname{Fin}(\\mathsf L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq U\">\\(E\\subseteq U\\)</span>为任意集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>是下式定义的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(U)\">\\(\\mathcal P(U)\\)</span>上的算子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{\\mathsf{NT}}\">\\(E_{\\mathsf{NT}}\\)</span>是其最小闭集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\alpha}\\Delta\">\\(\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\alpha}\\Delta\\)</span>为下式引入的三元元语言判断，不是对象语言谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi(E):={}&amp;\\{(\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta):\\exists s,t\\in\\mathsf T\\ \\exists X\\in V\\ [v(s)=v(t)\\land\\{\\langle\\in,s,X\\rangle,\\langle\\notin,t,X\\rangle\\}\\subseteq\\Delta]\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta):\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathsf W\\ \\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{CS}(F))\\ \\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ [(\\beta,\\rho,\\Delta\\cup\\{\\operatorname{CS}(F)(i)\\})\\in E]\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta):\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathsf D\\ \\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{CS}(F))\\ \\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ [(\\beta,\\rho,\\Delta\\cup\\{\\operatorname{CS}(F)(i)\\})\\in E]\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta):\\exists F\\in\\mathsf L\\ \\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ [\\operatorname{rk}(F)&lt;\\rho\\land(\\beta,\\rho,\\Delta\\cup\\{F\\})\\in E\\land(\\beta,\\rho,\\Delta\\cup\\{\\sim F\\})\\in E]\\},\\\\\nE_{\\mathsf{NT}}:={}&amp;\\bigcap\\{E\\subseteq U:\\Phi(E)\\subseteq E\\},\\qquad\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\alpha}\\Delta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta)\\in E_{\\mathsf{NT}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi(E):={}&amp;\\{(\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta):\\exists s,t\\in\\mathsf T\\ \\exists X\\in V\\ [v(s)=v(t)\\land\\{\\langle\\in,s,X\\rangle,\\langle\\notin,t,X\\rangle\\}\\subseteq\\Delta]\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta):\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathsf W\\ \\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{CS}(F))\\ \\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ [(\\beta,\\rho,\\Delta\\cup\\{\\operatorname{CS}(F)(i)\\})\\in E]\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta):\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathsf D\\ \\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{CS}(F))\\ \\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ [(\\beta,\\rho,\\Delta\\cup\\{\\operatorname{CS}(F)(i)\\})\\in E]\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta):\\exists F\\in\\mathsf L\\ \\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ [\\operatorname{rk}(F)&lt;\\rho\\land(\\beta,\\rho,\\Delta\\cup\\{F\\})\\in E\\land(\\beta,\\rho,\\Delta\\cup\\{\\sim F\\})\\in E]\\},\\\\\nE_{\\mathsf{NT}}:={}&amp;\\bigcap\\{E\\subseteq U:\\Phi(E)\\subseteq E\\},\\qquad\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\alpha}\\Delta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta)\\in E_{\\mathsf{NT}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>四行分别是源书的Ax、合取、析取和cut；合取型真数等式的空特征序列自动给出真等式公理，假数等式不能由析取规则产生。合取、析取保留主公式，与源书一致。算子单调，幂集交集给最小闭集；各非初始规则严格降低高度，因此与按α归纳的原定义相合。只需可数α、ρ，足以覆盖所有可数自治阶段。没有引入无来源的Deriv或Found黑箱。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language","status":"resolved","id":"7fc22c4e13a7c2b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language","status":"resolved","id":"7fc22c4e13a7c2b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用[[72-df-pohlers-infinitary-language]]的$\\mathsf L,\\mathsf W,\\mathsf D,v,\\operatorname{rk},\\operatorname{CS},\\sim$。$\\alpha,\\rho,\\beta\\in\\omega_1$，$\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Fin}(\\mathsf L)$，$F,G\\in\\mathsf L$；$\\Delta,F$缩写$\\Delta\\cup\\{F\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf L,\\mathsf W,\\mathsf D,v,\\operatorname{rk},\\operatorname{CS},\\sim","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\rho,\\beta\\in\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Fin}(\\mathsf L)","display":false},{"tex":"F,G\\in\\mathsf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta,F","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\cup\\{F\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\omega_1\\times\\omega_1\\times\\operatorname{Fin}(\\mathsf L)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(U)","display":false},{"tex":"E_{\\mathsf{NT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\alpha}\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi(E):={}&\\{(\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta):\\exists s,t\\in\\mathsf T\\ \\exists X\\in V\\ [v(s)=v(t)\\land\\{\\langle\\in,s,X\\rangle,\\langle\\notin,t,X\\rangle\\}\\subseteq\\Delta]\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta):\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathsf W\\ \\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{CS}(F))\\ \\exists\\beta<\\alpha\\ [(\\beta,\\rho,\\Delta\\cup\\{\\operatorname{CS}(F)(i)\\})\\in E]\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta):\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathsf D\\ \\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{CS}(F))\\ \\exists\\beta<\\alpha\\ [(\\beta,\\rho,\\Delta\\cup\\{\\operatorname{CS}(F)(i)\\})\\in E]\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta):\\exists F\\in\\mathsf L\\ \\exists\\beta<\\alpha\\ [\\operatorname{rk}(F)<\\rho\\land(\\beta,\\rho,\\Delta\\cup\\{F\\})\\in E\\land(\\beta,\\rho,\\Delta\\cup\\{\\sim F\\})\\in E]\\},\\\\\nE_{\\mathsf{NT}}:={}&\\bigcap\\{E\\subseteq U:\\Phi(E)\\subseteq E\\},\\qquad\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\alpha}\\Delta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\alpha,\\rho,\\Delta)\\in E_{\\mathsf{NT}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2718,"backlinks":[{"id":"3aa8b43b760f7cdb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用[[72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus]]及其语言。$\\alpha,\\lambda,\\beta\\in\\omega_1$。$A\\in\\mathsf L^{(2)}$是无集合参数的二数值孔模板；$R_A\\subseteq\\omega^2$及$D_A\\subseteq\\omega$由下式引入，$\\mathsf{Lin}(A)$表示它是其域上的严格线性序。$X\\in V$是任一固定集合参数。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-325","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus|df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus — Pohlers Infinitary Calculus]] · 补充：Pohlers 2009"}],"outgoing":["7fc22c4e13a7c2b8"]}